  "description": "CELKUB crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C58 H114 Dy4 N2 O26,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.713-3.955 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.06-112.13°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(μ3-OH)2(ampdH2)2(piv)10]·4CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
